/-!
# PDE obstruction generated by the native macro redirect runtime

The redirected infinite macro lineage is now one genuine chain of adjacent
unforced Galerkin receipts.  Its canonical Picard durations satisfy

```text
4 Tᵢ (Fᵢ + 1) = 1.
```

Hence an infinite source-generated redirect chain cannot remain in finite
physical time while both parts of its actual same-carrier generator stay
bounded.  The global source runtime generates exactly one of:

* a genuine infinite old shell lineage;
* unbounded physical time on the glued unforced chain;
* unbounded canonical nonlinear field; or
* unbounded unit-viscosity two-derivative field.

This is a PDE hard-gate reduction on the corrected physical lineage.  It is
not the legacy complete-round readout: every adjacent physical section here
has already been proved to glue, while every shell residual remains in the
whole residual carrier.
-/

